WEBVTT

01:42.880 --> 01:45.800
WEIYANG PUBLIC
SECURITY BUREAU NANSHAN BRANCH

01:45.880 --> 01:46.840
Over the past few days, we've checked in

01:46.920 --> 01:48.480
with taxi drivers and tricycle operators
across several districts.

01:48.560 --> 01:50.080
None of them picked up
any students heading to Yuanlongli.

01:50.160 --> 01:51.040
What about your side?

01:51.120 --> 01:52.320
Did you check

01:52.400 --> 01:53.440
the supermarkets and shops
around the school?

01:55.080 --> 01:56.560
We have a lead.

01:56.640 --> 01:57.480
Han Zi'ang finally spoke.

01:58.320 --> 01:59.480
What did he say?

02:00.160 --> 02:01.240
Something like this.

02:07.360 --> 02:08.440
"Charon.

02:09.440 --> 02:10.400
Charon the ferryman

02:11.160 --> 02:12.600
carries souls to Yinyi Village.

02:12.680 --> 02:13.960
Horse.

02:15.320 --> 02:16.640
The Trojan Horse.

02:17.280 --> 02:18.160
It eats people.

02:20.240 --> 02:21.440
It's going to eat you."

02:22.080 --> 02:22.960
What are you on about?

02:23.960 --> 02:25.800
He's not fully recovered yet.

02:25.880 --> 02:27.360
He's rambling about anime stuff.

02:27.440 --> 02:29.840
-Nonsense?
-Not exactly.

02:30.800 --> 02:31.640
Explain that.

02:32.360 --> 02:34.800
I can't quite piece it together yet,

02:34.880 --> 02:36.520
but I think what he said

02:36.600 --> 02:39.240
might be connected
to the real-world crime scene.

02:39.320 --> 02:40.320
We should try to decipher it.

02:43.640 --> 02:45.360
What kind of outfit
is that for a detective?

02:45.440 --> 02:46.600
-I was trying to…
-Enough.

02:46.680 --> 02:48.240
Stick to your job.

02:48.320 --> 02:49.840
Head back to the hospital
and stay with Han Zi'ang.

02:49.920 --> 02:52.400
When he's fully awake, question him again.

02:52.480 --> 02:55.160
Stop jumping to conclusions.
You're throwing us off.

02:55.240 --> 02:56.320
Go on.

02:57.040 --> 02:58.840
We've checked all the shops
around the school

02:58.920 --> 03:00.360
and pulled every camera we could find.

03:00.440 --> 03:02.360
Still, nothing unusual turned up.

03:10.960 --> 03:13.440
WHAT DOES TROJAN HORSE MEAN?

03:13.520 --> 03:16.040
If Qu Dahai could make sense of that,

03:16.120 --> 03:18.120
he wouldn't be on this Earth anymore.

03:19.160 --> 03:21.200
It's not entirely his fault.

03:22.240 --> 03:24.080
What Han Zi'ang said
isn't easy to figure out.

03:29.400 --> 03:33.280
If this Yinyi Village

03:34.120 --> 03:35.760
refers to Yuanlongli,

03:36.680 --> 03:38.800
then could Charon the ferryman

03:39.360 --> 03:41.480
be some kind of transport?

03:41.560 --> 03:44.760
The task force is focusing on vehicles.

03:44.840 --> 03:47.160
Commercial cars and tricycles.

03:48.000 --> 03:49.440
What about ride shares?

03:49.520 --> 03:50.800
What ride shares?

03:51.600 --> 03:54.400
Some shops restock
in the morning and at night.

03:55.040 --> 03:57.200
Drivers pick up extra passengers
along the way.

03:57.920 --> 03:59.960
Unlicensed cars like that are too random

04:00.040 --> 04:01.440
to track down.

04:03.800 --> 04:06.160
These five kids skipped school,

04:06.680 --> 04:08.880
but none of the road cameras caught them.

04:09.480 --> 04:11.120
I think we should check

04:11.200 --> 04:14.960
for construction sites near their school.

04:15.040 --> 04:16.120
If there is,

04:16.200 --> 04:18.079
it could mess with the cameras.

04:18.760 --> 04:20.480
Where's the map? Let me see it.

04:36.560 --> 04:38.440
DANFENG MIDDLE SCHOOL,

04:38.520 --> 04:40.440
WEIYANG NO. 2 MIDDLE SCHOOL
WEIYANG NO. 4 MIDDLE SCHOOL

04:47.640 --> 04:49.400
Focus here.

04:49.480 --> 04:50.840
BINCHUAN DISTRICT

04:50.920 --> 04:54.480
WEIYANG STADIUM, WENZHUANG

05:21.120 --> 05:22.880
JIAJIA GROCERY

05:37.400 --> 05:38.280
Where're my cigarettes?

05:49.080 --> 05:50.200
I dropped a pack on the road.

05:50.280 --> 05:51.600
I'll make it up to you.

05:52.400 --> 05:53.600
It's fine.

05:54.360 --> 05:55.200
Let me introduce myself.

05:55.280 --> 05:57.480
I'm Yuan Ziqiang. What about you?

05:59.280 --> 06:00.120
Here's the thing.

06:00.200 --> 06:03.240
I'm driving
to the provincial capital today

06:03.320 --> 06:05.120
to meet up with some friends
from my hometown.

06:05.200 --> 06:07.480
You've been saying
you want to go to Beijing.

06:07.560 --> 06:09.480
There's a train
from the provincial capital.

06:09.560 --> 06:11.880
Do you want to hitch a ride?

06:11.960 --> 06:13.360
I can drop you off there.

06:24.520 --> 06:25.600
About this tall.

06:25.680 --> 06:28.120
She's wearing a green jacket
and dark jeans.

06:28.200 --> 06:29.200
About this tall.

06:29.280 --> 06:30.400
Have you seen this girl?

06:30.480 --> 06:32.160
About this tall.
She's wearing a green jacket.

06:32.240 --> 06:33.120
No.

06:33.200 --> 06:34.480
-Mister, have you seen this girl?
-Mister,

06:35.280 --> 06:36.360
have you seen this girl?

06:37.240 --> 06:38.560
No.

06:38.640 --> 06:40.120
Alright. Thanks.

06:41.640 --> 06:43.840
-How much?
-Two yuan for half a kilo.

06:43.920 --> 06:45.560
Wrap up these three.

06:45.640 --> 06:47.480
JIAJIA GROCERY

06:54.480 --> 06:55.440
It's hot.

07:02.280 --> 07:03.320
Guys,

07:03.400 --> 07:05.480
we've checked eight stops.

07:05.560 --> 07:06.640
But there's not a single trace.

07:06.720 --> 07:08.720
That little tyke is probably gone.

07:08.800 --> 07:10.560
At this rate,

07:10.640 --> 07:11.920
we'll still be at it by Chinese New Year.

07:13.720 --> 07:15.320
Let's head back

07:16.080 --> 07:17.280
and come up with a new plan.

07:17.360 --> 07:20.040
Captain Ran told us to work the route.
There has to be a reason.

07:20.120 --> 07:21.120
Finish up and keep going.

07:22.880 --> 07:23.840
He's here.

07:27.640 --> 07:28.680
How's it going here?

07:29.840 --> 07:32.000
We've got this covered.
Why don't you get some rest?

07:32.080 --> 07:33.120
-You've been running yourself ragged.
-Here.

07:33.720 --> 07:34.840
Grab a bite.

07:35.840 --> 07:37.760
He Xiaohe is just
as insensible as her dad.

07:37.840 --> 07:39.640
Look at what she's doing to Captain Ran.

07:40.680 --> 07:41.760
Don't say that.

07:41.840 --> 07:43.440
I share the blame
for what happened to her.

07:43.520 --> 07:45.920
If I hadn't pushed Sir
to take on that case,

07:46.000 --> 07:48.240
his family might not have fallen apart.

07:49.000 --> 07:50.960
You keep calling him "Sir".

07:51.040 --> 07:52.320
Does He Yuanhang even deserve that?

07:56.280 --> 07:57.960
JIAJIA GROCERY

08:02.520 --> 08:03.840
JIAJIA GROCERY

08:09.800 --> 08:11.280
Did we check the supermarket?

08:13.840 --> 08:15.840
We just got to this street
and are about to check it out.

08:17.920 --> 08:20.920
"Suddenly, over the stream
We heard a pipa sound

08:21.560 --> 08:24.400
I forgot to go home,
And the guest stood spell-bound"

08:25.160 --> 08:27.200
Pen. Pen.

08:30.400 --> 08:32.440
"Song of a Pipa Player, by Bai Juyi.

08:33.039 --> 08:34.080
In the tenth year of Yuanhe's reign…"

08:34.159 --> 08:35.559
What can I get you, misters?

08:36.240 --> 08:37.400
We're with the Nanshan Branch.

08:38.200 --> 08:39.520
Have you seen this girl?

08:39.600 --> 08:41.120
MISSING PERSONS

08:45.080 --> 08:46.120
Have you seen her?

08:53.760 --> 08:55.040
Go back to your studies.

09:00.440 --> 09:03.440
"Suddenly, over the stream
We heard a pipa sound

09:03.520 --> 09:06.680
I forgot to go home,
and the guest stood spell-bound.

09:06.760 --> 09:09.360
We followed the music to its source,

09:10.360 --> 09:13.040
but heard the pipa stop,
and no music in the air.

09:13.560 --> 09:16.520
We moved our boat towards
the one whence came the strain,

09:17.680 --> 09:20.640
brought back the lamp,
asked for more wine and drank again.

09:21.160 --> 09:24.080
Repeatedly, we called
For the fair player still"

09:26.160 --> 09:27.120
Your son is working hard.

09:28.680 --> 09:30.480
He's in high school,
but his grades aren't great.

09:30.560 --> 09:31.760
So I keep an eye on his studies.

09:31.840 --> 09:33.000
Recite it again.

09:33.080 --> 09:34.960
"Song of a Pipa Player, by Bai Juyi.

09:35.760 --> 09:36.880
In the tenth year of Yuanhe's reign…"

09:36.960 --> 09:39.600
Let's move on to the next shop.

09:40.120 --> 09:41.640
Take care.

09:52.440 --> 09:54.120
Putting on a show is way harder

09:54.200 --> 09:56.000
than gaming.

09:56.080 --> 09:57.560
When that girl gets back with supplies,

09:57.640 --> 09:58.800
I'm going to send her home.

09:58.880 --> 10:01.040
-I'm heading inside to practice.
-Hold on.

10:01.640 --> 10:03.600
Wait till the cops are out of sight.

10:06.280 --> 10:08.240
We haven't checked
a hardware store up ahead,

10:08.320 --> 10:10.160
a barbershop, and a mahjong parlor.

10:11.440 --> 10:13.160
Wait. Stay here.

10:13.240 --> 10:14.280
Wait?

10:14.360 --> 10:15.280
How long?

10:18.720 --> 10:20.840
Five minutes. We'll go back to that shop.

10:27.640 --> 10:29.080
Hurry up. Cover for me.

10:29.160 --> 10:30.160
Come on.

10:42.760 --> 10:44.000
Is he your son too?

10:50.360 --> 10:51.400
You do magic tricks,

10:51.480 --> 10:53.040
and your son changes faces.

10:54.000 --> 10:55.320
Five minutes, and he has lost weight?

11:00.360 --> 11:01.760
Officer, I want to come clean.

11:02.560 --> 11:04.040
I saw that girl.

11:07.520 --> 11:09.160
Everyone, look to your left.

11:09.240 --> 11:12.440
This is the first stop
of our Mount Wu tour.

11:12.520 --> 11:13.720
Seeing flowers in the fog.

11:13.800 --> 11:15.920
If we come back in three or four months,

11:16.000 --> 11:18.200
you'll see flowers in the fog

11:18.280 --> 11:19.840
and fog among the flowers.

11:20.440 --> 11:21.800
The heavier the fog,

11:21.880 --> 11:23.280
the more dangerous it is
to head up to the mountain.

11:23.360 --> 11:26.280
Back on August 24th, 1995,

11:26.360 --> 11:28.360
there was an accident.

11:28.440 --> 11:30.040
So once you reach the resort,

11:30.120 --> 11:33.240
remember this, do not
go up the mountain on your own.

11:50.120 --> 11:51.920
JINGLIAN TEMPLE TUNNEL

11:52.000 --> 11:53.000
ROUTE 15 WEIYANG STADIUM TO WENZHUANG

12:11.800 --> 12:13.680
You're not a trafficker, are you?

12:14.880 --> 12:15.840
Sorry?

12:16.880 --> 12:18.760
You're not a trafficker, are you?

12:24.000 --> 12:25.080
Get off at the next stop.

12:25.960 --> 12:26.920
Find your own way back.

12:38.400 --> 12:40.720
JIAJIA GROCERY

12:40.800 --> 12:42.400
Mangkun, head over to Nanhu Market.

12:43.040 --> 12:44.040
Talk to the vendors.

12:47.040 --> 12:48.040
Find out who she hung out with.

12:48.960 --> 12:49.800
What about the four of them?

12:52.280 --> 12:53.240
IDs.

12:53.320 --> 12:54.520
We…

12:54.600 --> 12:56.000
We don't have IDs.

12:57.320 --> 12:59.080
They're in the cybercafé without IDs?

12:59.160 --> 13:01.440
Officer, this is an illegal cybercafé.

13:01.520 --> 13:03.760
It's not his fault. We're all over 18.

13:03.840 --> 13:06.120
We sold our IDs for money

13:06.200 --> 13:07.960
to pay for our training and competitions.

13:08.040 --> 13:10.240
This is gaming, not a competition.

13:10.320 --> 13:11.400
Qu.

13:12.280 --> 13:14.400
-Do you have surveillance here?
-Yes.

13:31.400 --> 13:33.560
Officer, this is the footage
from the past week.

13:38.400 --> 13:39.360
Officer,

13:39.440 --> 13:41.800
we really did see her passed out
in the alley late at night.

13:41.880 --> 13:44.360
We were afraid she'd freeze,
so we brought her back.

13:44.440 --> 13:46.480
This money-grabber squeezes
money out of us every day.

13:46.560 --> 13:48.520
Even if you break wind here,

13:48.600 --> 13:50.720
she'll chase you down and charge you
an air pollution fee.

13:50.800 --> 13:51.760
Sometimes,

13:51.840 --> 13:54.240
when Xiaohe saw us training hard,

13:54.320 --> 13:56.200
she would chip in
and buy us instant noodles.

13:56.280 --> 13:58.480
Yeah. She's not stingy.

13:58.560 --> 14:00.840
She said she was saving up
to go to Beijing.

14:00.920 --> 14:01.680
Beijing?

14:01.760 --> 14:04.040
-To learn rock music.
-That's right.

14:04.120 --> 14:05.240
Go to Beijing to learn rock music.

14:06.000 --> 14:07.200
When did she say that?

14:07.720 --> 14:10.280
ROUTE 15 WEIYANG STADIUM TO WENZHUANG
DONGLIWA STATION

14:27.480 --> 14:29.120
We'll stay there for the night.

14:31.160 --> 14:33.240
Didn't you say we were leaving today?

14:33.320 --> 14:35.760
My friend said
some of them haven't arrived yet.

14:35.840 --> 14:37.440
We'll head out together tomorrow
once everyone's here.

14:45.480 --> 14:46.800
HAPPY SHOPPING MART

14:51.080 --> 14:54.040
YOUCHENG HOTEL

15:14.600 --> 15:15.760
Come on in.

15:23.320 --> 15:24.320
Kid,

15:24.920 --> 15:26.320
you're suspicious of everything.

15:29.160 --> 15:30.000
Take a look at this.

15:35.040 --> 15:36.360
YUAN ZIQIANG'S IDENTITY CARD

15:39.600 --> 15:40.560
I'm not lying, right?

15:40.640 --> 15:41.480
CITIZEN IDENTIFICATION

15:42.360 --> 15:43.840
You can have it if you want.

15:54.720 --> 15:57.000
Captain Ran, look at this.

15:59.680 --> 16:01.640
This is footage from 11:05 a.m.

16:02.240 --> 16:03.120
After this man

16:03.640 --> 16:05.880
gave Xiaohe some money, she headed out

16:05.960 --> 16:07.080
and hasn't come back since.

16:11.840 --> 16:13.080
That guy with the glasses

16:13.160 --> 16:14.920
always had Xiaohe
pick up cigarettes for him.

16:15.000 --> 16:17.120
He never asked for change.
He's really generous.

16:30.480 --> 16:32.840
What do you do for a living?

16:33.480 --> 16:34.800
Construction.

16:34.880 --> 16:37.920
I go back and forth between Weiyang
and the provincial capital very often.

16:38.000 --> 16:39.000
And you?

16:39.080 --> 16:41.320
I noticed you've been staying
at the cybercafé every night.

16:41.400 --> 16:42.960
Doesn't your family check on you?

16:58.320 --> 17:00.320
Alright. Food's almost ready.

17:05.040 --> 17:06.920
Instant noodles again?

17:07.000 --> 17:09.560
I eat that three times a day
at the cybercafé.

17:10.079 --> 17:11.800
It makes me sick just looking at it now.

17:12.400 --> 17:13.400
Mister,

17:13.480 --> 17:16.240
can you buy me a proper meal?

17:24.480 --> 17:25.920
Little kid,

17:26.440 --> 17:28.119
you're such a hassle.

17:37.400 --> 17:38.200
Don't wander off.

17:38.800 --> 17:39.840
It's not safe out there.

17:40.360 --> 17:42.240
You might get snatched.

18:14.000 --> 18:15.960
-Who has the wanted list?
-I do.

18:16.840 --> 18:18.920
I picked up this habit at the station.

18:19.000 --> 18:20.280
I always carry it with me
whenever I'm out.

18:20.360 --> 18:20.960
WANTED LIST

18:44.280 --> 18:45.520
Let me introduce myself.

18:45.600 --> 18:47.800
I'm Yuan Ziqiang. And you?

18:48.760 --> 18:49.840
Take a look at this.

18:51.280 --> 18:52.600
LI QIANGYOU'S IDENTITY CARD

18:53.800 --> 18:55.920
LI HANGXING, "MEI" PROFILE

18:59.640 --> 19:02.440
"MEI" PROFILE

19:06.320 --> 19:07.560
HAO YOUQIANG'S IDENTITY CARD

19:14.680 --> 19:15.800
I'm not lying, right?

19:16.680 --> 19:18.160
You can keep it if you want.

19:21.400 --> 19:22.600
YUAN ZIQIANG'S IDENTITY CARD

19:23.720 --> 19:25.840
GAO ZHIQIANG
XIANG ZHIQIANG

19:29.400 --> 19:30.400
Looks like him?

19:32.000 --> 19:33.120
Yes, that's Mei.

19:34.040 --> 19:35.840
If Xiaohe has caught his attention,

19:35.920 --> 19:36.920
it's trouble.

19:37.440 --> 19:39.600
Mei is skilled at disguising himself.

20:11.720 --> 20:13.160
I bought you some meat buns.

20:24.680 --> 20:26.760
Yes. That's about it.

20:26.840 --> 20:29.520
Please contact us
as soon as you hear anything.

20:29.600 --> 20:30.640
Alright. Thank you.

20:31.520 --> 20:33.960
Captain Ran, we've contacted
the traffic police.

20:34.040 --> 20:35.400
They're pulling nearby
surveillance footage now.

20:35.480 --> 20:37.280
Liu, get more people on it.

20:37.800 --> 20:38.640
Alright.

20:40.320 --> 20:42.040
We've informed neighboring stations.

20:51.120 --> 20:52.360
Hello?

20:52.440 --> 20:55.240
Captain Ran, Xiaohe left
Nanhu Market around 4 p.m.

20:55.320 --> 20:57.000
Seven or eight vendors saw her.

20:58.520 --> 20:59.360
Got it.

21:02.920 --> 21:04.800
Which bus runs from Nanhu Market?

21:05.480 --> 21:06.440
Route 15.

21:06.520 --> 21:08.560
The stop should be
across from the main gate.

21:08.640 --> 21:10.080
ROUTE 15 WEIYANG STADIUM TO WENZHUANG
YANGLIU STREET

21:41.360 --> 21:42.400
When did the patrol car park there?

21:43.200 --> 21:45.080
Around 4:30 p.m.

21:46.520 --> 21:47.760
The patrol car scared her off.

21:48.920 --> 21:51.440
Xiaohe can't have been gone
for more than two hours.

21:51.520 --> 21:52.800
Based on a two-hour walking range,

21:52.880 --> 21:54.360
expand the search radius. Move.

21:54.440 --> 21:55.440
-Alright.
-Okay.

22:02.120 --> 22:03.600
WANG MANGKUN

22:07.440 --> 22:08.680
Hello, Mangkun?

22:08.760 --> 22:10.880
Head to the Route 15 terminal.

22:10.960 --> 22:13.160
Check with the drivers and conductors
and see if anyone spotted Xiaohe

22:13.240 --> 22:14.240
on the 4 p.m. run.

22:14.320 --> 22:15.640
Make it quick.

22:23.000 --> 22:23.840
ROUTE 15

22:23.920 --> 22:26.160
ROUTE 15 WEIYANG STADIUM TO WENZHUANG
YANGLIU STREET

22:32.720 --> 22:34.320
Do you have a phone charger?

22:34.400 --> 22:36.120
Yeah. I'll have someone bring one.

22:36.200 --> 22:37.400
Alright. Thanks.

22:37.480 --> 22:39.840
Officer He, this is a local specialty.

22:39.920 --> 22:41.360
Try it. It's sweet.

22:41.880 --> 22:43.360
Thank you. Thank you.

22:47.320 --> 22:48.240
Officer He,

22:48.760 --> 22:50.960
weren't the Xus

22:51.040 --> 22:53.680
already taken by that
demon building in Weiyang?

22:54.200 --> 22:55.040
You actually believe that?

22:57.040 --> 22:59.320
Officer He, to be frank,

22:59.400 --> 23:01.320
those two

23:01.400 --> 23:03.080
were harder to deal with than any demon.

23:05.880 --> 23:07.200
Back then, after the mountain accident,

23:07.280 --> 23:10.200
the government had
the travel agency and the scenic area

23:10.280 --> 23:12.320
reach out to the victims' families
about compensation.

23:12.400 --> 23:14.080
We went door to door.

23:14.160 --> 23:16.080
The Xu family signed,

23:16.160 --> 23:17.760
and we paid them.

23:17.840 --> 23:20.320
By right, that should've settled it.

23:20.400 --> 23:22.160
But not long after,

23:22.240 --> 23:23.760
Xu Meng showed up again
with her dad in a wheelchair.

23:23.840 --> 23:25.920
She said the medical fees weren't enough

23:26.000 --> 23:27.720
and demanded another payout.

23:27.800 --> 23:30.160
We were at our wits' end,

23:30.240 --> 23:31.480
so we gave them
another compensation payment.

23:31.560 --> 23:33.760
But before long, she came back again

23:33.840 --> 23:35.040
and started causing trouble.

23:35.120 --> 23:37.240
There was no way
we were paying them again.

23:38.040 --> 23:39.120
When we refused,

23:39.200 --> 23:41.960
she went after the scenic area staff
and harassed them instead.

23:42.600 --> 23:43.800
To be honest, Officer He,

23:43.880 --> 23:46.720
the way those two acted was disgraceful.

23:49.280 --> 23:51.600
Is the accident investigation report
still available?

23:52.320 --> 23:53.520
Yes. It's all still here.

24:10.160 --> 24:12.480
THE SUTRA OF INFINITE LIFE

24:39.360 --> 24:41.560
ANCIENT TOWN INN

24:43.040 --> 24:44.800
ANCIENT TOWN

24:53.840 --> 24:56.760
YOUCHENG HOTEL

25:04.760 --> 25:07.480
AMITĀYUS SUTRA

25:33.760 --> 25:34.960
Heading out?

25:41.920 --> 25:43.440
I… It'll take hours

25:43.520 --> 25:44.680
to get to the provincial capital.

25:45.280 --> 25:48.640
I want to pick up some food for the trip.

25:48.720 --> 25:50.240
That's not enough for you?

25:50.920 --> 25:53.280
It's all instant noodles and sausages.

25:53.360 --> 25:55.280
Even the buns have gone cold.

25:55.360 --> 25:56.760
I want to get some bread.

26:00.040 --> 26:02.120
You're quite a handful.

26:03.080 --> 26:06.040
There's a general store across the street.
It's cheaper there.

26:06.840 --> 26:07.760
Okay.

26:35.760 --> 26:37.320
-What's wrong, girl?
-Madam,

26:38.200 --> 26:39.040
I ran into some bad people.

26:39.120 --> 26:40.760
Can I borrow your phone
to call the police?

26:40.840 --> 26:42.640
Quick. Use the phone inside.

26:48.560 --> 26:50.800
Madam, where is it?

26:50.880 --> 26:52.120
What are you doing?

26:54.360 --> 26:55.400
Help!

27:30.040 --> 27:32.280
Uncle Ran, help me…

27:42.360 --> 27:44.200
ROUTE 15 WEIYANG STADIUM TO WENZHUANG

27:48.400 --> 27:49.520
YOUCHENG HOTEL

27:54.200 --> 27:56.400
DONGLIWA STATION, YOUCHENG HOTEL

28:05.000 --> 28:06.120
HAPPY SHOPPING MART

28:09.880 --> 28:11.160
HAPPY

28:11.240 --> 28:13.800
ROUTE 15 WEIYANG STADIUM TO WENZHUANG

29:02.400 --> 29:04.440
Officer He, sorry to keep you waiting.

29:04.520 --> 29:05.640
He should be here any minute.

29:05.720 --> 29:07.040
It's okay.

29:11.960 --> 29:13.440
Hurry it up.

29:14.200 --> 29:15.880
All you do all day is play games.

29:15.960 --> 29:17.240
You've kept Officer He waiting this long.

29:18.640 --> 29:19.560
It's alright.

29:19.640 --> 29:21.320
Kids will be kids.

29:21.400 --> 29:22.760
My daughter's the same.

29:22.840 --> 29:24.440
As long as they're safe

29:24.520 --> 29:25.720
and by our side, that's enough.

29:25.800 --> 29:27.920
-Let's go.
-Come.

29:34.080 --> 29:34.960
Is this the one?

29:35.040 --> 29:36.200
Yes, this is it.

29:36.280 --> 29:38.200
Right. Officer He, this is the file.

29:39.240 --> 29:40.080
ARCHIVE

29:40.160 --> 29:41.200
AUGUST 24TH MOUNT WU ACCIDENT REPORT

29:43.440 --> 29:44.280
There's quite a lot here.

29:46.200 --> 29:47.320
Could I get a copy?

29:47.400 --> 29:48.800
I'd like to take it back
and go through it carefully.

29:48.880 --> 29:49.720
Of course. No problem.

29:49.800 --> 29:51.040
Come. Make a copy for Officer He.

29:51.680 --> 29:53.440
That's a lot. How long will it take?

29:53.520 --> 29:55.440
My friends are waiting for me
at the cybercafé.

29:55.520 --> 29:56.760
Cybercafé, my foot.

29:56.840 --> 29:58.240
Get it copied now.

30:06.400 --> 30:09.080
ROUTE 15 WEIYANG STADIUM TO WENZHUANG

30:12.040 --> 30:13.680
This is the last stop. Get off the bus.

30:14.520 --> 30:15.400
Mm.

30:28.960 --> 30:29.920
Any updates?

30:30.000 --> 30:32.320
Captain Ran, a conductor saw Xiaohe.

30:32.400 --> 30:33.520
She was with Mei.

30:33.600 --> 30:36.240
They got off at the stop
near Youcheng Hotel.

30:36.320 --> 30:37.840
Youcheng Hotel?

30:38.440 --> 30:39.600
YOUCHENG HOTEL

30:42.480 --> 30:43.480
Sir.

30:43.560 --> 30:44.760
Sir. Sir.

30:46.560 --> 30:48.440
-You have a death wish…
-Police.

30:48.520 --> 30:50.760
You should've said so earlier.

30:52.560 --> 30:53.920
Sir, pull over.

30:55.840 --> 30:56.920
YOUCHENG HOTEL

31:01.320 --> 31:02.280
Police.

31:03.160 --> 31:04.560
Have you seen these two?

31:07.600 --> 31:09.840
Yes. Room 206.

31:09.920 --> 31:11.000
They checked out.

31:13.080 --> 31:14.560
MANAGER'S OFFICE

31:21.320 --> 31:22.680
Pause.

31:24.160 --> 31:25.200
Give me that.

31:42.320 --> 31:43.240
Do you have cameras outside?

31:43.320 --> 31:46.320
We're a small business.
We don't have that many cameras.

31:46.400 --> 31:48.160
YOUCHENG HOTEL

31:59.520 --> 32:00.800
HAPPY SHOPPING MART

32:01.840 --> 32:03.040
Do you have the phone number

32:03.120 --> 32:04.280
-for the shop owner across the street?
-Yes.

32:04.360 --> 32:05.280
Let me find it.

32:06.360 --> 32:08.760
The owner went back to their hometown.
The shop's been closed for a week.

32:09.440 --> 32:10.560
Back home?

32:11.560 --> 32:14.560
-I saw her locking up just an hour ago.
-That's impossible.

32:14.640 --> 32:15.880
What does the owner look like?

32:15.960 --> 32:17.040
A tall, thin woman?

32:17.120 --> 32:19.600
It's a retired old man.
He has no children.

32:57.240 --> 32:58.320
CHUAN N 97023

33:00.200 --> 33:02.680
CHUAN N 97023

33:12.600 --> 33:13.520
Fangxu.

33:14.040 --> 33:16.560
Contact the traffic police to run a plate.

33:16.640 --> 33:19.280
Chuan N 97023, silver van.

33:19.360 --> 33:21.280
Xiaohe might be inside. Faster.

33:30.280 --> 33:31.680
MENTOR

33:45.080 --> 33:46.240
RAN

33:48.400 --> 33:50.760
Hello? Why are you still up?

33:53.480 --> 33:54.480
Sir.

33:55.000 --> 33:56.120
What's wrong?

33:56.200 --> 33:57.640
Did something happen?

33:59.800 --> 34:00.800
Yes.

34:05.200 --> 34:07.280
What happened? Just tell me.

34:10.520 --> 34:11.639
Xiaohe

34:12.280 --> 34:13.800
has been taken by human traffickers.

34:15.639 --> 34:17.840
I've got people tracking the vehicle.

34:19.040 --> 34:20.719
They should still be in Weiyang.

34:21.239 --> 34:23.600
All the exits are covered.

34:32.000 --> 34:33.400
Please send those printed files

34:33.480 --> 34:35.000
to the Nanshan District Police Station.

34:35.520 --> 34:36.400
-Thank you.
-It's okay.

34:36.480 --> 34:37.600
Sure. Take your time.

34:42.280 --> 34:44.000
Pull over. Pull over.

34:45.080 --> 34:45.840
Sir.

34:48.960 --> 34:50.639
Pull over. Sir.

34:54.760 --> 34:55.639
-Where to?
-Weiyang.

35:06.240 --> 35:07.600
CHUAN N 97023

35:11.720 --> 35:14.160
Hurry. Get her in the van.

35:14.760 --> 35:15.960
You idiot.

35:16.040 --> 35:17.400
Cut back on the buns.

35:17.480 --> 35:19.400
I said cut back. Cut back.
All you ever do is eat.

35:19.480 --> 35:20.520
Hurry up.

35:25.160 --> 35:29.240
CHUAN N 97023

35:31.320 --> 35:32.760
If we pull this off,

35:33.360 --> 35:34.640
this is a big score.

35:38.840 --> 35:40.440
Fangxu, 15 minutes ago,

35:40.520 --> 35:41.640
traffic cams picked up the van

35:41.720 --> 35:43.680
heading west past the train station.

35:44.200 --> 35:46.080
Everyone to the station.
Set up along the route.

35:46.160 --> 35:47.120
Copy that.

35:56.320 --> 35:57.400
MENTOR

36:01.000 --> 36:02.880
-Sir.
-I'm almost in Weiyang.

36:02.960 --> 36:04.680
Where is the trafficker?
Have you locked onto them?

36:04.760 --> 36:06.440
They're heading toward
Weiyang Train Station.

36:06.520 --> 36:07.400
Got it.

36:07.920 --> 36:09.280
Train station, sir. Faster.

36:15.240 --> 36:16.520
We've got two kids in the van.

36:18.640 --> 36:19.640
Don't worry.

36:28.080 --> 36:29.280
Alright. I got it.

36:33.720 --> 36:35.720
Mei said he picked up a nine-year-old boy.

36:36.480 --> 36:37.400
He's waiting at the usual spot.

36:49.960 --> 36:54.800
WEI TUNNEL 9

36:56.040 --> 36:58.520
One minute ago, the van
was seen on camera heading south

36:58.600 --> 37:00.800
through Wei Tunnel 9 on Highway 410.

37:13.760 --> 37:15.200
MENTOR

37:16.080 --> 37:17.800
-Sir.
-What's the plate number?

37:17.880 --> 37:20.160
Chuan N 97023. Silver van.

37:20.240 --> 37:22.400
Just passed the Wei Tunnel 9,
heading south.

37:22.480 --> 37:23.560
I'll cut it from outside the city.

37:23.640 --> 37:24.960
Same plan. Block them from both ends.

37:25.600 --> 37:26.680
Got it.

37:27.560 --> 37:28.920
Sir, faster, please.

37:29.000 --> 37:30.120
Thank you.

38:07.200 --> 38:08.920
Mei says there's
a checkpoint on the highway.

38:09.000 --> 38:10.840
Take a left at the next junction.
There's a repair shop.

38:10.920 --> 38:12.080
He'll wait there.

38:33.640 --> 38:35.040
Turn right on the highway.

38:38.400 --> 38:39.600
What's wrong?

38:41.920 --> 38:43.160
Drive.

38:43.240 --> 38:44.280
We're out of gas.
We're not going anywhere.

38:44.360 --> 38:46.520
-No?
-Out of gas.

39:17.240 --> 39:18.680
Still trying to run?

39:18.760 --> 39:19.680
Dare to run?

39:19.760 --> 39:20.880
You think you can run away?

39:22.240 --> 39:24.000
Hold her down.

39:24.520 --> 39:25.360
Help!

39:28.080 --> 39:29.040
Hit her.

39:31.680 --> 39:33.680
Dare to run away? Now?

39:34.280 --> 39:36.080
Run? Asking for death?

39:45.320 --> 39:46.680
I'm going to beat you up!

39:50.960 --> 39:52.440
You rascal.

39:53.280 --> 39:54.560
Step on it.

39:54.640 --> 39:56.040
Get in the car,

39:56.120 --> 39:57.880
or you're dead.

39:58.720 --> 40:00.560
Throw me out if you dare.

40:00.640 --> 40:02.480
Fine, you're dead.

40:13.320 --> 40:14.840
-Get out!
-Are you crazy?

40:14.920 --> 40:16.920
-Police. Everyone out of the vehicle!
-Dad!

40:17.000 --> 40:18.200
-Dad, I'm here!
-Out!

40:18.280 --> 40:19.520
Dad, I'm here!

40:20.720 --> 40:22.320
-Run him over.
-Dad!

40:23.240 --> 40:24.960
-Help!
-Step on the gas!

40:25.040 --> 40:26.880
-He's a cop.
-You chickened out?

40:26.960 --> 40:27.880
All of you, out!

40:27.960 --> 40:28.840
-Run him over!
-Dad!

40:28.920 --> 40:29.800
Help!

40:29.880 --> 40:30.840
Quick!

40:32.880 --> 40:34.680
Dad! Dad!

40:42.400 --> 40:44.160
-Get out!
-Help me!

40:44.240 --> 40:46.400
Get out! Get out!

40:46.480 --> 40:47.760
Move!

40:48.560 --> 40:50.000
-Don't hit my dad!
-Move!

40:50.080 --> 40:51.840
I said get out!

40:53.000 --> 40:53.880
Out of my way!

40:54.680 --> 40:55.960
Don't hit my dad!

40:56.040 --> 40:57.840
I won't forgive you!

41:00.800 --> 41:02.880
-Step on it.
-Don't hit my dad!

41:02.960 --> 41:04.360
Run him over!

41:08.920 --> 41:10.360
Dad!

41:10.440 --> 41:11.600
Dad!
